{"id":"357a074b53493d1a","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Predecessor Set","display":"df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set — ZFC Order7 Predecessor Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set — ZFC Order7 Predecessor Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set — ZFC Order7 Predecessor Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq X\">\\(P\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}predecessor\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S(X,R,x,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land P=\\{y\\in X:(y,x)\\in R\\land y\\ne x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}predecessor\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S(X,R,x,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land P=\\{y\\in X:(y,x)\\in R\\land y\\ne x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and relation are explicitly typed, so the separation term is a\nset and the distinguished point lies in the relation's field.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}predecessor\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7PredecessorSet}_S(X,R,x,P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land P=\\{y\\in X:(y,x)\\in R\\land y\\ne x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2956","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set.md|58-df-zfc-order7-predecessor-set]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2aa29158e60b337f","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}